  # ── fzf builtins ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  "bind	Ctrl-t	fzf	Insert a file path at the cursor (fd backend, bat preview)"
  "bind	Alt-c	fzf	cd into a directory (fd backend, eza tree preview)"
  "bind	Ctrl-r	fzf	Search shell history — ctrl-y copies selected command"

  # ── added to cover the full current surface ──
  "bind	Ctrl-a D	Sessions	Claude Code session dashboard — overview of running claude sessions"
  "cmd	gwtt / gwt-tidy	Worktrees	Review and remove merged worktrees across all bare repos. Only offers ones that are merged, clean, fully pushed, not the default branch and have no live session. Branches are never deleted — undo with gwta <branch>"
